{"4561110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Budget Renovation Simulator", "steam_appid": 4561110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Budget Renovation Simulator, your goal is simple: take a total disaster and turn it into a goldmine. You don’t have a big bank account, so you’ll need to be smart, fast, and very careful with every cent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 Smart Budgeting Every dollar matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you buy a brand-new door or just sand down the old one? Manage your cash flow to finish the renovation before your bank account hits zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 The Clearance Hunt </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the luxury showrooms. Your best friends are &quot;Last Chance&quot; bins and clearance aisles. Find mismatched paint, leftover tiles, and used fixtures. It doesn't have to be perfect - it just has to look good!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧼 Restore, Don't Replace </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save a fortune by cleaning what others would throw away. Use your tools to scrub off years of grime, strip old wallpaper, and polish rusty pipes. A little hard work is much cheaper than buying new stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Maximize Your Profit </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game rewards efficiency. The less you spend, the more you earn. Use your profits to buy bigger, messier houses and prove that you are the king of the budget makeover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn a wreck into a dream home on a tiny budget? Grab your tools and start flipping!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Budget Renovation Simulator, your goal is simple: take a total disaster and turn it into a goldmine. You don’t have a big bank account, so you’ll need to be smart, fast, and very careful with every cent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 Smart Budgeting Every dollar matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you buy a brand-new door or just sand down the old one? Manage your cash flow to finish the renovation before your bank account hits zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 The Clearance Hunt </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the luxury showrooms. Your best friends are &quot;Last Chance&quot; bins and clearance aisles. Find mismatched paint, leftover tiles, and used fixtures. It doesn't have to be perfect - it just has to look good!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧼 Restore, Don't Replace </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save a fortune by cleaning what others would throw away. Use your tools to scrub off years of grime, strip old wallpaper, and polish rusty pipes. A little hard work is much cheaper than buying new stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Maximize Your Profit </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game rewards efficiency. The less you spend, the more you earn. Use your profits to buy bigger, messier houses and prove that you are the king of the budget makeover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn a wreck into a dream home on a tiny budget? Grab your tools and start flipping!</p>", "short_description": "Turn &quot;Trash&quot; into &quot;Cash&quot;! 💰 Buy wrecked houses, hunt for the cheapest materials, and fix them up for a massive profit. Spend the least to make the most in this renovation challenge! Can you finish the job without going broke?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561110/170b2089aab7a61decaf815b6b2400b95f57975a/header.jpg?t=1786980486", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steam